    "body": "Fact from the review of the v0.24.0 release gate fix (PR #2564): `cargo xtask release` (`xtask/src/release.rs:186-194`) plans the release tier and does not call `known_fail::check_issues`. `cut.yml` uses `gate release`, which calls it. This issue already lists that item, so no second issue is filed for it.\n",
